  "title": "Om Ali",
  "description": "Cooked pieces of puff pastry are combined with nuts, raisins and coconut, covered in hot sweetened milk and cream and placed under the broiler in this hot Egyptian dessert you can eat with a spoon.",
  "authors": [
    "NANCY GIRGIS"
  ],
